<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5982] The query cannot hit the model when there is an internal table</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5982</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproduction steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create a project, turn on internal tables&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Load data source table&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create internal table&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Then use this table to model and build&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After the model is built, the model is queried. It is expected to hit the model, but the query shows a downward pressure (and the downward pressure does not hit the internal table).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
